# Question authoring sources ARE committed: see learn/content/dp-600/questions/src.
# The answer obfuscation protects the shipped bundle, which is what a player
# would inspect. It cannot protect a public repo, and pretending otherwise
# would cost the ability to maintain the bank for no real gain.

# Generated question banks written by the capacity host.
#
# Not committed, deliberately. These are drafted by a model and reviewed by
# whoever happened to be sitting there, so they are somebody's working notes
# rather than content this project stands behind. The shipped DP-600 bank is
# checked by tests; this is not, and mixing the two in one repository would
# make it impossible to tell them apart later.
tools/coach/banks/
